    "昼夜地图的海陆与地形来自 Natural Earth（公有领域）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昼夜地图的海陆与地形来自Natural Earth（公有领域）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "晝夜地圖的海陸與地形來自Natural Earth（公有領域）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Land, sea, and relief on the day and night map come from Natural Earth (public domain)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昼夜の地図の陸地・海・地形はNatural Earth（パブリックドメイン）によるものです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "낮과 밤 지도의 육지·바다·지형은 Natural Earth(퍼블릭 도메인)에서 가져왔습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Land, Meer und Relief der Tag- und Nachtkarte stammen von Natural Earth (gemeinfrei)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tierra, el mar y el relieve del mapa de día y noche provienen de Natural Earth (dominio público)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les terres, les mers et le relief de la carte jour-nuit proviennent de Natural Earth (domaine public)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terra, mar e relevo do mapa de dia e noite vêm do Natural Earth (domínio público)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Суша, море и рельеф на карте дня и ночи взяты из Natural Earth (общественное достояние)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ląd, morze i rzeźba terenu na mapie dnia i nocy pochodzą z Natural Earth (domena publiczna)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Land, zee en reliëf op de dag-en-nachtkaart komen van Natural Earth (publiek domein)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terre, mari e rilievi della mappa giorno-notte provengono da Natural Earth (pubblico dominio)."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Đất liền, biển và địa hình trên bản đồ ngày đêm lấy từ Natural Earth (thuộc phạm vi công cộng)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gündüz ve gece haritasındaki kara, deniz ve yer şekilleri verileri Natural Earth’ten (kamu malı) gelir."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daratan, laut, dan relief pada peta siang dan malam berasal dari Natural Earth (domain publik)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "题记「天涯共此时」出自张九龄《望月怀远》，「It is always sunrise somewhere.」出自 John Muir《John of the Mountains》（1938）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "题记“天涯共此时”出自张九龄《望月怀远》，“It is always sunrise somewhere.”出自John Muir《John of the Mountains》（1938）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "題記「天涯共此時」出自張九齡〈望月懷遠〉，「It is always sunrise somewhere.」出自John Muir《John of the Mountains》（1938）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The epigraph “It is always sunrise somewhere.” is from John Muir, John of the Mountains (1938)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "題辞“天涯共此时”は張九齢の“望月懐遠”から、“It is always sunrise somewhere.”はJohn Muirの“John of the Mountains”（1938）からの引用です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "인용문 “天涯共此時”는 장구령의 『망월회원』에서, “It is always sunrise somewhere.”는 John Muir의 『John of the Mountains』(1938)에서 가져왔습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Motto „Tianya gong ci shi“ stammt aus „Wang yue huai yuan“ von Zhang Jiuling; „It is always sunrise somewhere.“ stammt aus „John of the Mountains“ von John Muir (1938)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cita “It is always sunrise somewhere.” procede de John Muir, John of the Mountains (1938)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’épigraphe « À l’autre bout du monde, nous partageons cet instant » est tirée du poème « Contempler la lune en pensant à ceux qui sont loin » de Zhang Jiuling. « It is always sunrise somewhere. » est tiré de John of the Mountains (1938), de John Muir."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A epígrafe chinesa “Tianya gong ci shi” vem do poema “Wang yue huai yuan”, de Zhang Jiuling; “It is always sunrise somewhere.” vem de John of the Mountains (1938), de John Muir."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Строка «Даже на краю света мы переживаем один и тот же миг» взята из стихотворения Чжан Цзюлина «Глядя на Луну, думаю о тех, кто вдали», а «It is always sunrise somewhere.» — из книги Джона Мьюра John of the Mountains (1938)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Motto „Na krańcach świata dzielimy tę chwilę” pochodzi z wiersza Wang yue huai yuan (Zhang Jiuling), a „It is always sunrise somewhere.” z książki John of the Mountains (John Muir, 1938)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het Chinese motto 'Ver weg delen we dit moment' komt uit 'Bij maanlicht denk ik aan wie ver weg is' van Zhang Jiuling. 'It is always sunrise somewhere.' komt uit John of the Mountains (1938) van John Muir."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’epigrafe “Tianya gong ci shi” è tratta da Wang yue huai yuan di Zhang Jiuling; “It is always sunrise somewhere.” è tratta da John Muir, John of the Mountains (1938)."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Câu đề từ “Thiên nhai cộng thử thì” trích từ Vọng nguyệt hoài viễn của Trương Cửu Linh; “It is always sunrise somewhere.” trích từ John of the Mountains (1938) của John Muir."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Dünyanın iki ucunda aynı anı paylaşırız” anlamındaki Çince epigraf, Zhang Jiuling’in “Aya Bakıp Uzaktakini Özlemek” şiirinden alınmıştır. “It is always sunrise somewhere.” ise John Muir’in “John of the Mountains” (1938) kitabından alınmıştır."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kutipan “Tianya gong ci shi” berasal dari puisi Wang Yue Huai Yuan karya Zhang Jiuling; “It is always sunrise somewhere.” berasal dari John Muir, John of the Mountains (1938)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
